## Requirements

- Python @@python@@ or later
- [uv](https://docs.astral.sh/uv/) (package and environment manager)
- Make

## Getting started

```bash
make install            # dependencies and pre-commit hooks
cp .env.example .env    # then fill in the values. .env is gitignored
make lint               # ruff check and format check
make typecheck          # mypy, strict
make unit-tests         # pytest with coverage
```

## Commands

| Command | What it does |
|---|---|
| `make install` | `uv sync` and install the pre-commit hooks |
| `make lint` | `ruff check` and `ruff format --check` |
| `make format` | Apply ruff fixes and formatting |
| `make typecheck` | `mypy` in strict mode on `src/` |
| `make lint-yaml` | `yamllint` on `.github/` and `configs/` |
| `make unit-tests [path=<dir>]` | pytest with coverage. `COV_FAIL_UNDER=<n>` sets the coverage gate |
| `make cleanup` | Remove caches and build artifacts |

